          "verification": "visual-review"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "O Deus, cujus tam fortis amor est, ut te parvum fieri infantulum compulerit, tanti nobis tui amoris cognitionem concede, ut ad reciprocum amorem animati, te aeternum amare, laudare, et benedicere valeamus. Amen.",
          "english": "O God, whose love is so strong that it moved Thee to become a little infant, grant us the knowledge of Thy great love, that, stirred to love Thee in return, we may be able to love, praise, and bless Thee eternally. Amen.",
          "sourcePages": [
            52
          ],
          "translation": {
            "kind": "prepared",
            "preparedFor": "Sacrum Florilegium",
            "sourcePages": [
              52
            ],
