          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "Dum lachrymis tam bellulos aspicio natare tuos Jesu ocellulos, queis culpas vis lavare: latis cor meum gestibus exultans tenerescit, et sic amoris aestibus ut cera colliquescit: amorem hunc perpendere, cor suum est accendere.",
          "english": "When I behold Thy lovely little eyes, O Jesus, swimming in tears,\nWith which Thou dost will to wash away sins,\nMy heart grows tender, exulting with abundant gladness,\nAnd thus melts like wax in the heat of love.\nTo ponder this love\nIs to kindle one’s heart.",
